 "text": " Hello, this is Aamina from Cynia Bank. How can I help you today? Hi Aamina, I sent money through M-Pesa two hours ago, and the person hasn't received it. I'm so sorry to hear that. Let me check this for you right away. The money left my account, but they're telling me they got nothing. Can I have the phone number you sent the money to? 0712. Thank you. Let me pull up the transaction. Um, I can see it here. It's showing us processing. Sometimes M-Pesa transactions can take up to two hours. But since it's been that long, I'll escalate this to our M-Pesa team now. How long will that take? I need this sorted out. The person is waiting for this money. I completely understand your frustration. I've marked this as urgent. The team will call you back within 30 minutes. And if the money hasn't reflected in the next hour, we'll reverse it back to your account. Okay, 30 minutes. Fine, but if I don't hear back, I'll be calling again. That's completely fair. You'll get a call from our team. Let me also send you an SMS with the reference number. Sawa. Thank you. Sawa, pull for the inconvenience. We'll sort this out. Anything else I can help with? No, that's all. Asante sana for calling. Have a good day.",
